abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin and pair of portable Agent Skills that set a project's bearing
  (Standard, Context, Constraints, Problem, Tools), flag drift from it on every prompt, and
  record deliberate, PM-confirmed course changes in an append-only logbook.
